<table border=0 cellpadding=2><tr>
<td valign=top nowrap><font color="#006400"><b>結婚式やりますｗ</b></font>　投稿者：<b>ルシファー</b> <small>投稿日：2001/06/26(Tue) 07:16</small> <font color="#006400"><small>No.2065</small></font></td><td valign=top nowrap> &nbsp;  </td><td valign=top>
<form action="./yybbs.cgi" method=POST>
<input type=hidden name=mode value=res>
